ectories.\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"ver_005_paired_comparison\\\": {\\n    \\\"base_collected\\\": 1552,\\n    \\\"candidate_collected\\\": 1564,\\n    \\\"delta_collected\\\": 12,\\n    \\\"base_passed\\\": 1550,\\n    \\\"candidate_passed\\\": 1562,\\n    \\\"base_subtests_passed\\\": 11642,\\n    \\\"candidate_subtests_passed\\\": 11813,\\n    \\\"base_failures\\\": [\\n      [\\n        \\\"tests/test_b_guard.py::TestTm018Guard::test_tm018_live_check_subprocess\\\",\\n        \\\"call\\\",\\n        \\\"AssertionError\\\",\\n        \\\"AssertionError: 2 != 0 : mode=PLANNED maxbytes=106496 canon=/Users/aazhiry1/Мой диск/Context/AGENTS.md size=63079\\\"\\n      ],\\n      [\\n        \\\"tests/test_muse_bridge_killpg.py::AllowedModelsSyncTest::test_t00_models_and_health_include_wonder_models_400k\\\",\\n        \\\"call\\\",\\n        \\\"AssertionError\\\",\\n        \\\"AssertionError: 1048576 != 400000 : wrong contextWindow for muse-wonder-full-1.0 in /Users/aazhiry1/.dsh/profiles/desktop/cordis.patch.yml\\\"\\n      ]\\n    ],\\n    \\\"candidate_failures\\\": [\\n      [\\n        \\\"tests/test_b_guard.py::TestTm018Guard::test_tm018_live_check_subprocess\\\",\\n        \\\"call\\\",\\n        \\\"AssertionError\\\",\\n        \\\"AssertionError: 2 != 0 : mode=PLANNED maxbytes=106496 canon=/Users/aazhiry1/Мой диск/Context/AGENTS.md size=63079\\\"\\n      ],\\n      [\\n        \\\"tests/test_muse_bridge_killpg.py::AllowedModelsSyncTest::test_t00_models_and_health_include_wonder_models_400k\\\",\\n        \\\"call\\\",\\n        \\\"AssertionError\\\",\\n        \\\"AssertionError: 1048576 != 400000 : wrong contextWindow for muse-wonder-full-1.0 in /Users/aazhiry1/.dsh/profiles/desktop/cordis.patch.yml\\\"\\n      ]\\n    ],\\n    \\\"multiset_delta_candidate_minus_base\\\": [],\\n    \\\"raw_logs\\\": {\\n      \\\"ver-005-base-collect.log\\\": \\\"678739397fa9959138691eaf9bf75fb36571d140f59b3d5f7d91d835d7b7cc1d\\\",\\n      \\\"ver-005-candidate-collect.log\\\": \\\"da7d0de2484031421f703c050517e7af468e1a756fc95ec0836790849421812f\\\",\\n      \\\"ver-005-base.log\\\": \\\"0222aa69a36099d34a35fc7d6b24148ae2aaccf12743bb5c4c6d11d7c2b10bea\\\",\\n      \\\"ver-005-candidate.log\\\": \\\"dcbe85699969ede84fafae6545603b799ddeaa2e85703b4df384c7bbbbe1c993\\\"\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"cache_policy\\\": \\\"Disabled (-p no:cacheprovider, PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1); fresh detached git worktrees from 012da99905ec27a6133afb4f3e768ff9b4426a8f.\\\"\\n}\\n===TRACE===\\n# Verification Traceability Matrix (`agy-universal-image-fallback-20261029`)\\n\\n| Requirement / ADR / Invariant | Verification Check IDs | Test Oracles (`tests/test_agy_bridge_resilience.py`) | Clean-Room Status |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| `AD-001`, `REQ-01`, `INV-01`, `INV-09` (Independent fail-closed `IMAGE_FALLBACK_ENABLED` flag, universal catalog acceptance without `proof`/`sha256`, strict validation preserved) | `VER-003`, `VER-006`, `VER-007`, `VER-009` | `test_uf01_default_flag_off_keeps_strict_rejection_behavior`, `test_uf02_universal_accepts_all_catalog_models_and_efforts_without_proof`, `test_uf09_validation_limits_and_non_user_role_still_guarded` | `PASS` (`exit=0`) |\\n| `AD-002`, `REQ-06`, `INV-02..04` (Complete media normalization & stripping across full history, including `A..E` unknown-only and `F..K` `dict`-content with `type=\\\"text\\\"` and extra payload keys) | `VER-003`, `VER-005`, `VER-007`, `VER-009` | `test_uf07_media_normalization_is_complete`, `test_uf07b_collect_downgrade_clears_hot_and_explicit_cid` | `PASS` (`exit=0`) |\\n| `AD-003`, `REQ-02..03`, `INV-05..09, 11..12` (Three safe downgrade points: `collect`, `post_slot`/`spool`, and `runtime`; `img_dir` cleanup; CAS session invalidation; 1-attempt media reserve; SSE delivery lock) | `VER-003`, `VER-005`, `VER-007` | `test_uf03_collect_downgrade_when_image_input_disabled_sends_text_only`, `test_uf03b_post_slot_and_spool_downgrade_to_text_only`, `test_uf04_runtime_rejection_retries_once_without_images_json_and_sse`, `test_uf05_sse_no_fallback_after_first_delivered_token`, `test_uf06_hot_session_invalidated_and_not_poisoned_on_fallback`, `test_uf08_retry_budget_and_temp_dir_cleanup_under_concurrency`, `test_uf08b_runtime_fallback_runs_even_when_retry_budget_pre_exhausted` | `PASS` (`exit=0`) |\\n| `AD-004`, `REQ-04`, `INV-10` (`/health` and `/v1/models` effective `images` + `image_fallback` metadata; sanitized `image_fallback` log event with `media-degradation-reserve` in `_LOG_EVENT_NAMES`) | `VER-003`, `VER-007`, `VER-009` | `test_uf10_health_models_and_structured_fallback_logs` | `PASS` (`exit=0`) |\\n| `AD-005`, `INV-12` (Zero deletions in `tests/test_agy_bridge_resilience.py`, frozen `fleet.json`, `test_images_strict.py` green, full repository suite `VER-005` parity) | `VER-001`, `VER-002`, `VER-004`, `VER-005`, `VER-006`, `VER-008` | `UniversalImageFallbackTests` (`+1,615 / -0` lines after byte `249,933`), `VER-005` (`1,562` passed vs `1,550` on `BASE`, `2 == 2` identical pre-existing failures) | `PASS` / `PASS_WITH_PREEXISTING` |\\n| `REQ-05` (Production deploy to `~/.dsh/bridges/agy-bridge/` + live DSH chat acceptance) | `VER-010` | `teamlead/live-acceptance.json` | `DEFERRED_L3` (mandatory post-Council before MR/close) |\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 16533,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 4134,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
